  "instructions": [
    "Heat a pan over medium heat.",
    "Add shrimp, soy sauce, fish sauce, and minced garlic. Stir fry for about 5 minutes until shrimp are pink and just cooked through.",
    "Stir in dashi stock and sherry. Let simmer for another 3-4 minutes until the liquid has slightly thickened.",
    "If using dumpling filling, add it to the pan now and stir well until combined with the sauce.",
    "Season with salt and pepper as desired.",
    "Serve immediately as a light dinner dish."
